#: src/Abilities/Abilities/DeleteCoupon.php:71
msgid "Must be true to confirm deletion. Before setting this to true, warn the user: \"Warning: Deleting this coupon will permanently remove it and all associated promotions. This action cannot be undone. Are you sure you want to continue?\""
